  "solution": {
    "text": "Given:<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>180</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math><br /><br />Thus, <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> &nbsp;&nbsp; Here <math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>x</mtext> <mtext>1</mtext> </msub> <mo>,</mo><msub> <mtext>x</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext></mrow> </math> are percentage weights."
